status GREEN -- three reds closed: stash_record (unlanded=0), log_file_claim (staged_unwritten=0), rish_report_bound (sites 39 to 38). gitlink_dependent GREEN with probe (37 legs, fail=0); reds_ledger_monotone, session_roster_agree, index_row_bound, log_has_a_row, exec_bit, ascii_document, unshared_citation, reds_citation, itinerary_account_shelf all GREEN. Hot roster pass 254 guards, tree_moved=no.
recommend keep-going -- the loom is sized and unbuilt: 21 gating scans whose route to their own names lives in a comment, against a repair shape this tree already runs in fleet_round_open. A second door opened on the rebase: two ships folded one ledger row to two shelves within minutes, which the fold recital can see and no gate does.
